],[24408,16.4,2002,57,114,17],[24409,16.7,1974,60,115,17]],"links":[["Washington County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/colorado/washington-county"],["ARC or PLC in Washington County","/arc-plc/colorado/washington-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 15 grids February to March and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 40 of 75 years. In 2025, April to May came in at 54% of normal on the county&rsquo;s middle value. In 2026 so far, January to February sits at 23% of normal on the county&rsquo;s middle value. Grid 23506 had its driest year in 1954 at 49%.</p>"}
